** Auto-Updates/Patching **

It is extremely important for administrators to be able to update, patch, and back up all connected endpoints.

Difficult to maintain reliable patching and backup schedules is realted to the sheer number of differents devices and procedures performing updates and backups

Having a standarized desktop, laptop, server, and smart phone model and manufacturer for a company can greatly simplify the task of patch and update maintenance.

This not always viable because of the need to support critical legacy quipement, and the rise of bring your own device, or BYOD, in work enviroments.

