** Backups **

Assist in recovery from cyberattacks or accidents

Many IoT devices do not have a backup capability

- Having backup equipement that you can configure easily to replace damaged, stolen, or compromised devices should be part of a
  comprehensive disaster recovery plan.

- having a regular backup schedule is one of the most effective ways to mitigate a ransomware attack.
